      "role": "user",
      "content": "Group Anagrams\n\nGiven an array of strings strs, group the anagrams together. You may return the answer in any order.\n\nExample: ['eat','tea','tan','ate','nat','bat'] -> [['eat','tea','ate'],['tan','nat'],['bat']].\nConstraints: 1 <= len(strs) <= 10^4, strs[i] consists of lowercase English letters.",
      "id": "m-0",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-13T12:05:31.002Z",
      "durationMs": 0
    },
